        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add details to the <code class=\"notranslate\">tabGroups</code> API to describe the difference in tab group behavior between Firefox and Chrome, following the change in Firefox 142 to leave active tabs within a collapsed tab group.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1978643\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1978643</a> Verify that active tab stays active when tabGroups.collapsed is set to true with tabGroups.update()</p>",
